      <h2 id="field-terminal-contract-heading">
        THE LOCK SCREEN CARRIES THE RECORD. THE HOME SCREEN STAYS QUIET.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="link-list">
      <li>
        <h3>LOCK FIELD</h3>
        <p>
          Use the supplied plate as the lock screen. Keep the upper register
          clear enough for the device clock and status indicators.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>HOME FIELD</h3>
        <p>
          Use solid black (<code>#000000</code>). The absence of a second
          illustration keeps app labels and notifications legible.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>ICON SIGNAL</h3>
        <p>
          When the operating system supports icon tinting, use oxide green
          (<code>#4ADE80</code>) at restrained intensity.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>LAYOUT DISCIPLINE</h3>
        <p>
          Keep one calm page of essential instruments. Move everything else to
          the app library or drawer; the exact app roster remains operator-held.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

