        <h3>EDIT THE TOKENS</h3>
        <p>
          The standalone source keeps the palette at the top of the document.
          Change the text or colors, open the file in a browser, and capture the
          1320 × 2868 canvas.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>ADAPT DELIBERATELY</h3>
        <p>
          The master ratio is approximately 19.5:9. Different screen ratios may
          need deliberate repositioning; preserve the clock-clearance field
          rather than relying on an automatic stretch.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>PUBLIC USE</h3>
        <p>
          Personal device use is permitted. Personal, non-commercial adaptations
          are permitted with Forgotten Industries credit when shared. The FI
          name and shield may not be used to imply endorsement or sold as a
          standalone mark.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>BOUNDARY</h3>
        <p>
          The package contains no app roster, account information, device
          identifier, location, private intake record, or operator credential.
        </p>
      </li>
